<p>Emily M. Bender, Timnit Gebru, Angelina McMillan-Major, Shmargaret Shmitchell. 2021.</p>
<p>On the Dangers of Stochastic Parrots: Can Language Models Be Too Big? <a href="http://faculty.washington.edu/ebender/papers/Stochastic_Parrots.pdf" class="uri">http://faculty.washington.edu/ebender/papers/Stochastic_Parrots.pdf</a></p>
